{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Agreed illustration scope",
      "text": "Project: The Moon Kite, a children's picture book\nSeller: Lira Malinaw, illustrator, Philippines\nBuyer: Nao Fushimi\nService fee: JPY 84,000, payable through PayPal\nAgreed scope:\nCreate four full-color illustrations of the fox protagonist.\nProvide a front-cover illustration with space reserved for the title.\nDeliver three spot illustrations of woodland objects.\nProvide a black-and-white coloring-page version of the fox.\nThe illustrations are for a short print run and a digital edition. Final files will be supplied electronically, with the cover and interior art in separate folders. Both parties approved this scope before work began."
    },
    {
      "title": "Illustration handover note",
      "text": "From: Lira Malinaw\nTo: Nao Fushimi\nProject: The Moon Kite\nI have uploaded the final handover folders and sent you access to them. The interior folder contains four full-color fox illustrations: Fox at Dawn, Fox by the Stream, Fox on the Hill, and Fox Under the Moon. The cover folder contains the front-cover illustration with space reserved for the title. The spot-art folder contains two woodland object illustrations: a pine cone and a mushroom. No third spot illustration is included. The handover contains no black-and-white coloring-page version of the fox. Please check the files at your convenience."
    },
    {
      "title": "Chat after delivery",
      "text": "Nao, 10:14: I opened the folders. The four fox scenes and the cover look good on my screen.\nLira, 10:19: Glad they opened properly. Were you able to see the pine cone and mushroom too?\nNao, 10:22: Yes, both are there. I was expecting another woodland object, though.\nLira, 10:27: You're right. I only sent those two; I haven't made the third one.\nNao, 10:31: I also couldn't find the coloring page.\nLira, 10:36: I didn't prepare or deliver it. I can discuss a schedule for the outstanding work with you."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
